{"id":"a8519e320aac8e03","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-kurepa-tree.md","title":"Kurepa Tree","display":"df-kurepa-tree — Kurepa Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-kurepa-tree","aliases":["58-df-kurepa-tree"],"display":"df-kurepa-tree — Kurepa Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-branch.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-kurepa-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-kurepa-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kurepa-tree — Kurepa Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tree.md\">../batch18/58-df-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"686ef3328616b54f\" href=\"?note=686ef3328616b54f\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-branch.md\">../batch09/58-df-branch.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"15016c1e1dd46781\" href=\"?note=15016c1e1dd46781\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"091259c83b563d39\" href=\"?note=091259c83b563d39\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md\">../batch11/58-df-order-type.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa,b\\in V\">\\(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa,b\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tree}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tree}\\)</span> (tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tree.md\">../batch18/58-df-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Branch}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Branch}_S\\)</span> (maximal-branch predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"686ef3328616b54f\" href=\"?note=686ef3328616b54f\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-branch.md\">../batch09/58-df-branch.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S\\)</span> (tree-level predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"15016c1e1dd46781\" href=\"?note=15016c1e1dd46781\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S\\)</span> (tree-height predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"091259c83b563d39\" href=\"?note=091259c83b563d39\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\)</span> (order-type predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md\">../batch11/58-df-order-type.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kurepa\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Tree}(T,&lt;_{T})\\land\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists L\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\alpha,L)\\land|L|&lt;\\kappa\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\left|\\left\\{b\\subseteq T:\\mathrm{Branch}_S(b,T,&lt;_{T})\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\bigl(\\kappa,b,(&lt;_{T}\\cap b^2)\\setminus\\Delta_b\\bigr)\\right\\}\\right|&gt;\\kappa.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kurepa\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Tree}(T,&lt;_{T})\\land\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists L\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8LevelOfTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\alpha,L)\\land|L|&lt;\\kappa\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\left|\\left\\{b\\subseteq T:\\mathrm{Branch}_S(b,T,&lt;_{T})\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\bigl(\\kappa,b,(&lt;_{T}\\cap b^2)\\setminus\\Delta_b\\bigr)\\right\\}\\right|&gt;\\kappa.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Tree levels, tree height, and branch order type are supplied by their actual upstream predicates rather than by undefined <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lev}\">\\(\\operatorname{Lev}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ht}\">\\(\\operatorname{ht}\\)</span>, or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{otp}\">\\(\\operatorname{otp}\\)</span> accessors.</li>\n<li>Kurepa trees have more than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> many cofinal branches.</li>\n<li>For the classical <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> case, existence is independent of ZFC relative to the customary consistency assumptions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-branch.md","status":"resolved","id":"686ef3328616b54f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-branch.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree8-level-of-tree.md","st